# Intelligent Port Resource & Traffic Management System

An advanced full-stack application engineered to streamline and optimize port operations. This system integrates core **Operating System (OS)** process scheduling and multithreaded resource allocation with **Database Management System (DBMS)** transactions, wrapped inside a modern **React and Tailwind CSS** user interface.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** React, Vite, Tailwind CSS
- **Backend & OS Logic:** C++ (Process scheduling, multithreading, resource management algorithms)
- **Database:** MySQL / Relational Database schemas for port transactions
- **Tools:** Git, GitHub, VS Code, Cisco Packet Tracer (Network topology)

---

## 📁 Repository Structure

```text
OS_DBMS_Project/
├── Backend/
│   ├── database/    # DBMS schema scripts, tables, and transactional queries
│   └── OS_Logic/    # C++ implementations for OS resource allocation & scheduling
└── Frontend/        # React + Vite + Tailwind CSS dashboard UI for port operations